{
  "name": "Elemental Gift",
  "type": "feat",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You begin to take on characteristics of your patron's kind. You now have Resistance to a damage type determined by your patron's kind: bludgeoning (dao), thunder (djinni), fire (efreeti), or cold (marid).</p><p>In addition, as a Bonus Action, you can give yourself a Fly Speed of 30 feet that lasts for 10 minutes, during which you can hover. You can use this Bonus Action a number of times equal to your Proficiency bonus, and you regain all expended uses when you finish a Long Rest.</p>",
